```

This prevents temporary files, uploaded PDFs and generated vector databases from unnecessarily entering GitHub.

**Important:** Keep your sample documents in `data/documents/` only if the company permits you to submit them.

## Step 4: Final project test

Run:

```powershell
streamlit run app.py
```

Check these four features:

- [ ] Upload two PDFs.
- [ ] Select one PDF and ask a question.
- [ ] Select All Documents and ask a question.
- [ ] Check the source filename, page number and evidence.

<badge color="success">Almost ready for submission</badge>